{%- comment -%}
  XERO compare — DELIBERATELY EMPTY. Do not restore.

  This section rendered a side-by-side table against an unnamed "class leader" at a
  named price, with a competitor power figure that was invented rather than sourced.
  Two problems, either of which is enough on its own:

    1. Comparative advertising against an identifiable rival has to be substantiated
       with the actual tested figures for both machines. We do not have theirs.
    2. The owner's instruction is explicit and standing: no comparison section.

  The file stays because the Admin API cannot delete theme files - it can only
  overwrite them. An empty file is how a section gets retired. The preset is gone
  too, so the section can no longer be added from the theme editor.

  If a comparison is ever wanted again it needs sourced, citable figures for every
  machine named, and sign-off. Do not rebuild it from memory.
{%- endcomment -%}

